ost</i> <br><i>One misstep and you fall off a ridge</i> <br><i>Read a landscape, and follow traversal </i><br> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK, APPLICANT! </strong><br> *follow cheat sheet to complete run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807750/extras/089f32080d05ce66bd0648ca1a61fa38.poster.avif?t=1786987410\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807750/extras/089f32080d05ce66bd0648ca1a61fa38.webm?t=1786987410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807750/extras/089f32080d05ce66bd0648ca1a61fa38.mp4?t=1786987410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807750/extras/5305d1c2851db23f34e96f86ac4d958a.poster.avif?t=1786987410\" width=1170 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807750/extras/5305d1c2851db23f34e96f86ac4d958a.webm?t=1786987410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807750/extras/5305d1c2851db23f34e96f86ac4d958a.mp4?t=1786987410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREETING, VICE! WELCOME TO VISION THE TRAINING PROGRAM!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invision soon will launch you to new realm. Hellgate was defined as the starting point. If you succeed the Vision, you'll be deployed to planet surface. Colonization will begin!</p><p class=\